//@version=6
indicator("Sniper PUT 6.4 – MACD Breakdown (1-Min)", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500)
// IMPORTANT: Run this script on 1-minute chart only
// Trading window: 09:30 - 15:30 IST
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CHANGE HISTORY — newest first
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// v6.4 — 2026-06-23 — TREND_CONTINUATION falling-confluence (cut late/exhaustion entries)
//
//  PROBLEM (Jun-23 live, 413-trade analysis): on a down day, BAD-regime PUT entries did WORSE
//  than NEUTRAL (40% vs 63% win) — entering AFTER the stock already fell, on exhausted moves
//  → 0% gains / bounces. 94/219 BAD-regime entries never went green. sustainedHistDrop (3-6 bar
//  falling) fires anywhere in a long fall, including the exhausted bottom.
//
//  FIX (slight tightening — mirror of CE rising-confluence; structure kept): require the breakdown
//  to be ACTIVELY accelerating at the entry bar, which exhausted bottoms are NOT:
//    1. contVolumeStrong: + volume > volume[1]  (selling pressure increasing, not tapering)
//    2. contRsiOversold:  + rsi < rsi[1]         (RSI still falling, not flattening)
//    3. contEmaFalling = ema9 < ema20 and ema9 < ema9[1]  (replaces loose emaTrendFlexible)
//    (vwapFalling already required.) Histogram/sustainedHistDrop structure unchanged.
//
//  TO REVERT v6.4 → v6.3:
//    contVolumeStrong = volume >= volMa * contVolFloor and volume < volMa * contVolCeil
//    contRsiOversold = rsi < 38
//    In trendContinuationTrigger replace contEmaFalling with emaTrendFlexible; delete contEmaFalling.
//    Change indicator title back to "Sniper PUT 6.3".
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// v6.3 — 2026-06-21 — TREND_CONTINUATION volume band (data-driven, 651-trade TC analysis)
//
//  ROOT CAUSE: contVolumeStrong required volume > 1.5× volMa with NO upper cap.
//  The data shows that gate is positioned exactly wrong for PUT:
//    - 1.2-1.5× band (EXCLUDED by the old 1.5× floor): 68% win, +3.49 avg — the BEST band
//    - 1.5-2.5× band (kept): 56% win, +2.01 avg
//    - >2.5× capitulation (kept): 51% win, +1.26 avg — ~half of all TC alerts, weakest
//  High volume on a down-candle is exhaustion/capitulation (→ bounce), not confirmation.
//
//  FIX: contVolumeStrong = volume in [contVolFloor × volMa, contVolCeil × volMa)
//    Defaults: floor 1.5→1.2 (capture the 68% band), ceiling none→2.5 (drop capitulation).
//    Net intent: shift TC toward the profitable moderate-volume zone AND cut ~half the
//    alert spam (the >2.5× capitulation trades). Tunable via the two inputs below.
//
//  TO REVERT v6.3 → v6.2:
//    contVolumeStrong = volume > volMa * 1.5
//    Delete contVolFloor / contVolCeil inputs.
//    Change indicator title back to "Sniper PUT 6.2".
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// v6.2 — 2026-06-19 — TREND_CONTINUATION histogram quality gate (data-driven, today's 104-trade analysis)
//
//  ROOT CAUSE: TREND_CONTINUATION was firing on near-zero histograms (hist ≈ 0 to -0.15).
//  sustainedHistDrop only requires macdHist < 0, so -0.02 passed. These entries
//  showed two failure modes:
//    1. Too early (reversal risk): weak hist, stock hadn't committed to downside yet
//    2. Too late: stock already fell big (INFY -7.8%), hist flattening, about to bounce
//  In both cases: peak = 0%, never moved.
//
//  DATA: 84 TREND_CONTINUATION trades, 19% win rate.
//        33 losers had hist > -0.20, all with near-zero peak.
//        14 of those also had rangeExpansion = false.
//
//  FIX: Added contHistQuality gate on trendContinuationTrigger only:
//    contHistQuality = macdHist <= -0.20 OR rangeExpansion
//    Logic: need either real MACD momentum (hist < -0.20) OR confirmed
//    range break (stock genuinely expanding its bearish range).
//    Three borderline winners (BANKBARODA, MOTHERSON, HINDPETRO) all had
//    rangeExpansion = true with hist ≈ 0 — they survive via the OR clause.
//    No winners killed. 14 dead trades cut. Win rate: 18.6% → 21.6%.
//
//  TO REVERT v6.2 → v6.1:
//    Delete the contHistQuality line.
//    Remove "and contHistQuality" from trendContinuationTrigger.
//    Change indicator title back to "Sniper PUT 6.1".
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// v6.1 — 2026-06-17 — Market quality gate (data-driven, 299-trade PUT OTM analysis)
//
//  ROOT CAUSE: Two specific market+signal combinations caused disproportionate losses:
//
//  Finding 1: NEUTRAL market day + |macd_hist| 0.30–0.80 = 49% WR, 5 HARD_SL hits
//    NEUTRAL day = niftyChange between -0.5% and +0.4% (no directional tailwind)
//    Mid-hist zone = signal has some conviction but not enough to overcome neutral market
//    Result: coin-flip WR with HARD_SL asymmetry. Sides of this zone are fine:
//      hist < 0.30 (fresh zero-cross) = 61% WR ← kept
//      hist >= 0.80 (deeply oversold)  = 64% WR ← kept
//
//  Finding 2: GOOD market day (niftyChange >= 0.4%) + stock UP on day (dayChange >= 0)
//    5 HARD_SL hits: HINDALCO +0.65%, COFORGE +0.90%, AUBANK +1.85%, others
//    Pure counter-trend — stock rallying on rising NIFTY, PUT had no chance
//
//  FIX: Added putMarketQualityOK gate (applied to all 4 triggers):
//    neutralMidHistRisk  = neutralMarket AND |hist| in [0.30, 0.80)  → blocked
//    goodDayCounterTrend = goodMarket AND dayChange >= 0              → blocked
//
//  TO REVERT v6.1 → v6.0:
//    Delete lines defining neutralMarket, goodMarket, neutralMidHistRisk,
//    goodDayCounterTrend, putMarketQualityOK (5 lines in ENTRY TRIGGERS section).
//    Remove "and putMarketQualityOK" from all 4 trigger lines.
//    Change indicator title back to "Sniper PUT 6.0".
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// v6.0 — 2026-06-13 — vs v5.3:
//  1. deepBreakdownTrigger: relaxed from trendFilterStrict+deadDropFilter
//     to trendFilterFlexible+sessionBreakdownFilter — catches stocks already
//     deep in negative MACD territory (the #1 cause of missed losers)
//  2. rsiWeakness: added oversold escape (rsi < 35) so temporary RSI bounces
//     at extreme lows don't block real breakdown setups
//  3. sessionBreakdownFilter: dayChange threshold -0.35 → -0.20 and added
//     intraday structure fallback for mid-session breakdowns
//  4. sustainedHistDrop: added 3-bar and 4-bar alternatives alongside 5/6
//     so brief MACD histogram bounces don't kill the sequence
//  5. Added TREND_CONTINUATION entry type: fires on stocks already in a
//     confirmed multi-bar downtrend with RSI < 38, volume ≥ 1.5× avg,
//     and stock day-change ≤ -0.5% — meant for BAD/NEUTRAL market days
//
//  TO REVERT v6.0 → v5.3:
//    Restore trendFilterStrict+deadDropFilter in deepBreakdownTrigger.
//    Remove rsi < 35 escape from rsiWeakness.
//    Revert sessionBreakdownFilter dayChange threshold to -0.35.
//    Revert sustainedHistDrop to 5/6-bar only.
//    Remove entire TREND_CONTINUATION block (stockDayLoser through trendContinuationTrigger).
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

//──────── INPUTS ────────
emaFast = input.int(9, "EMA Fast")
emaSlow = input.int(20, "EMA Slow")
rsiLen = input.int(14, "RSI Length")
rsiMax = input.float(58.0, "RSI Max Entry (Breakdown)")  // raised 55→58
macdFast = input.int(12, "MACD Fast")
macdSlow = input.int(26, "MACD Slow")
macdSignalLen = input.int(9, "MACD Signal")
bbLen = input.int(20, "BB Length")
bbStd = input.float(2.0, "BB StdDev")
volMaLen = input.int(20, "Volume MA Length")
volMultiplier = input.float(1.2, "Volume Multiplier")
// v6.3: TREND_CONTINUATION volume band. Edge is at moderate volume (1.2-2.5×); >2.5× is
// capitulation (bounce risk). Floor captures the best 1.2-1.5× band; ceiling drops capitulation.
contVolFloor = input.float(1.2, "TC Volume Floor (×volMa)")
contVolCeil = input.float(2.5, "TC Volume Ceiling (×volMa)")
niftySymbol = input.symbol("NSE:NIFTY", "NIFTY Symbol")
histFloor = input.float(0.20, "Histogram Floor Magnitude")
histBurstMultiplier = input.float(2.0, "Histogram Burst Multiplier")
deadDropLookback = input.int(30, "Dead Drop Lookback (bars)", minval=10, maxval=60)
showLabels = input.bool(true, "Show Labels")
isExpectedTimeframe = timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier == 1

//──────── CORE INDICATORS ────────
ema9 = ta.ema(close, emaFast)
ema20 = ta.ema(close, emaSlow)
rsi = ta.rsi(close, rsiLen)
[macdLine, macdSignal, macdHist] = ta.macd(close, macdFast, macdSlow, macdSignalLen)
[bbUpper, bbMiddle, bbLower] = ta.bb(close, bbLen, bbStd)
bbWidth = (bbUpper - bbLower) / bbMiddle * 100
volMa = ta.sma(volume, volMaLen)
vwapVal = ta.vwap(hlc3)
prevDayClose = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", close[1], barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
dayOpen = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", open, barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
niftyPrevClose = request.security(niftySymbol, "D", close[1], barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
niftyClose = request.security(niftySymbol, "D", close, barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
niftyChange = niftyPrevClose > 0 ? (niftyClose - niftyPrevClose) / niftyPrevClose * 100 : 0
dayChange = prevDayClose > 0 ? (close - prevDayClose) / prevDayClose * 100 : na

//──────── TREND FILTER ────────
macdHistFalling = ta.falling(macdHist, 2)
emaTrendStrict = ema9 < ema20 and ema20 < ema20[1]
emaTrendFlexible = ema9 < ema20 or macdHistFalling
emaResistance = high <= ema9 or close < ema9
emaSlope = ema9 < ema9[1] and ema9[1] < ema9[2]
trendFilterStrict = emaTrendStrict and emaResistance and emaSlope
trendFilterFlexible = emaTrendFlexible and emaResistance and emaSlope

//──────── VOLUME FILTER ────────
volFilter = volume > volMa * volMultiplier

//──────── RANGE / VOLATILITY FILTERS ────────
bodySize = math.abs(close - open)
avgBody = ta.sma(bodySize, 10)
strongCandle = bodySize > avgBody * 1.2

candleRange = high - low
avgRange = ta.sma(candleRange, 10)
rangeExpansion = candleRange > avgRange * 1.3

atr = ta.atr(14)
atrExpansion = atr > atr[1]

bbAvgWidth = ta.sma(bbWidth, 10)
bbCompression = bbWidth < bbAvgWidth * 0.8
bbExpansion = bbWidth > bbWidth[1] and bbWidth[1] >= bbWidth[2] and bbWidth[2] >= bbWidth[3]
bbFilter = bbCompression or (bbExpansion and close < bbMiddle)

//──────── RSI WEAKNESS FILTER ────────
// FIX: added oversold escape — at RSI < 35 the stock is already deeply weak;
// a one-bar RSI bounce at those levels should not block a real breakdown signal.
rsiFalling = ta.falling(rsi, 2)
rsiWeakness = (rsi < rsiMax and rsiFalling) or rsi < 35

//──────── MACD HISTOGRAM BREAKDOWN SEQUENCE ────────
// shift candle: histogram flips from positive to negative
// confirm candle: negative histogram reaches at least -0.20
// burst candle: negative histogram doubles the prior candle magnitude
histShiftPrevBar = macdHist[2] >= 0 and macdHist[1] < 0
histConfirmCandle1 = macdHist[1] <= -histFloor
histBurstCandle2 = macdHist < 0 and math.abs(macdHist) >= math.abs(macdHist[1]) * histBurstMultiplier and macdHist < macdHist[1]
// On 1-minute charts the next bar often opens exactly at the previous close.
// Allow equality so real breakdown continuation candles are not filtered out.
priceBurstCandle2 = open <= close[1]
volumeBurstCandle2 = volume > volMa
burstSequenceReady = histShiftPrevBar and histConfirmCandle1 and histBurstCandle2 and priceBurstCandle2 and volumeBurstCandle2

// Many real red-session leaders never give a clean positive-to-negative MACD flip intraday.
// Allow continuation breakdowns once the histogram is already decisively negative.
// The stricter trend, structure, and sustained-drop gates below still control quality.
histContinuationCandle2 = macdHist < -histFloor
continuationVolumeCandle2 = volume > volMa * 0.9
continuationSequenceReady = histContinuationCandle2 and priceBurstCandle2 and continuationVolumeCandle2
sequenceReady = burstSequenceReady or continuationSequenceReady

// FIX: added 3-bar and 4-bar alternatives — intraday MACD histograms frequently
// bounce one bar even in a strong downtrend; requiring 5-6 consecutive bars was
// blocking real breakdown setups on high-beta stocks.
histDrop3 = ta.falling(macdHist, 3)
histDrop4 = ta.falling(macdHist, 4)
histDrop5 = ta.falling(macdHist, 5)
histDrop6 = ta.falling(macdHist, 6)
sustainedHistDrop = (histDrop3 or histDrop4 or histDrop5 or histDrop6) and macdHist < 0

// Preserve telemetry fields similar to the CE script.
histShiftCandle0 = histShiftPrevBar
macdLineConfirmCandle1 = macdLine[1] <= macdLine[2] and macdSignal[1] <= macdSignal[2]
rsiConfirmCandle1 = rsi < rsi[1]
volumeConfirmCandle1 = volumeBurstCandle2
emaConfirmCandle1 = priceBurstCandle2
vwapConfirmCandle1 = histBurstCandle2
bbConfirmCandle1 = macdHist < -0.05
priceConfirmCandle1 = priceBurstCandle2
openWeaknessCandle2 = priceBurstCandle2

// Classify the same burst setup by the MACD regime on the shift candle.
deepContext = macdLine[1] >= 0 and macdSignal[1] >= 0
accelerationContext = macdLine[1] < 0 and macdSignal[1] < 0
neutralBreakdownContext = not deepContext and not accelerationContext

histVelocity = histBurstCandle2

distanceFromEMA = math.abs(close - ema9) / ema9 * 100
confirmDistanceFromEMA = math.abs(close[1] - ema9[1]) / ema9[1] * 100
notExtended = distanceFromEMA < 1.5
confirmNotExtended = confirmDistanceFromEMA < 1.5
deepReversalSetup = deepContext and sequenceReady

//──────── PRICE STRUCTURE & VWAP FILTER ────────
lowerHigh = high < high[1] and high[1] <= high[2]
bearishClose = close < open
vwapFalling = close < vwapVal and vwapVal < vwapVal[1]
// FIX: OR-based — need bearishness on at least one dimension, not both simultaneously.
// Full AND made the condition too brittle when the breakdown candle is a doji.
priceStructure = (lowerHigh or bearishClose) and vwapFalling

//──────── DEAD-DROP FILTERS ────────
// Pine cannot verify the next 30 minutes without repainting, so this uses a strict 30-bar non-rising proxy.
seriesDeadDrop(series) =>
    enoughBars = not na(series[deadDropLookback])
    enoughBars and series < series[5] and series[5] <= series[10] and series[10] <= series[15] and series[15] <= series[20] and series[20] <= series[25] and series[25] <= series[deadDropLookback]

vwapDeadDrop = seriesDeadDrop(vwapVal)
rsiDeadDrop = seriesDeadDrop(rsi)
emaDeadDrop = seriesDeadDrop(ema9) and seriesDeadDrop(ema20)
bbDeadDrop = seriesDeadDrop(bbUpper) and bbMiddle < bbMiddle[5] and close <= bbLower * 1.01
deadDropScore = (vwapDeadDrop ? 1 : 0) + (rsiDeadDrop ? 1 : 0) + (emaDeadDrop ? 1 : 0) + (bbDeadDrop ? 1 : 0)
deadDropFilter = deadDropScore >= 2

// FIX: lowered dayChange threshold -0.35 → -0.20 so mid-session breakdowns
// on stocks that opened flat but dropped intraday still qualify.
// Added intraday MACD structure fallback for cases where day-change is minimal
// but the stock is clearly in a confirmed intraday downtrend.
intradayBreakdownStructure = macdHist < -histFloor and emaTrendFlexible and vwapFalling and close < ema20
sessionBreakdownFilter = deadDropFilter or (dayChange <= -0.20 and vwapFalling and emaTrendFlexible and rsiWeakness) or (intradayBreakdownStructure and rsiWeakness)

//──────── TIME FILTER ────────
hourIST = hour(time, "Asia/Kolkata")
minuteIST = minute(time, "Asia/Kolkata")
inTradeWindow = (hourIST == 9 and minuteIST >= 30) or (hourIST >= 10 and hourIST < 15) or (hourIST == 15 and minuteIST <= 30)

//──────── CONFIDENCE SCORING ────────
score = 0.0
score += neutralBreakdownContext ? 20 : 0
score += histShiftPrevBar ? 20 : 0
score += histConfirmCandle1 ? 10 : 0
score += histBurstCandle2 ? 20 : 0
score += sustainedHistDrop ? 10 : 0
score += priceBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0
score += volumeBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0

deepScore = 0.0
deepScore += deepContext ? 20 : 0
deepScore += histShiftPrevBar ? 20 : 0
deepScore += histConfirmCandle1 ? 10 : 0
deepScore += histBurstCandle2 ? 20 : 0
deepScore += sustainedHistDrop ? 10 : 0
deepScore += priceBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0
deepScore += volumeBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0

momentumTrendStrict = ema9[1] < ema20[1] and ema20[1] <= ema20[2] and close[1] < ema9[1]
momentumHistAccel = histShiftCandle0 and histConfirmCandle1 and histVelocity
momentumRSI = rsi[1] < 50 and rsi[1] < rsi[2]
momentumVolume = volumeConfirmCandle1
momentumCandles = close[1] < open[1] and close[1] <= close[2]
momentumVol = atr[1] >= atr[2] or bbWidth[1] >= bbWidth[2]
momentumNotExtended = confirmNotExtended and open > bbLower

momentumAccelSetup = accelerationContext and sequenceReady

momScore = 0.0
momScore += accelerationContext ? 20 : 0
momScore += histShiftPrevBar ? 20 : 0
momScore += histConfirmCandle1 ? 10 : 0
momScore += histBurstCandle2 ? 20 : 0
momScore += sustainedHistDrop ? 10 : 0
momScore += priceBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0
momScore += volumeBurstCandle2 ? 10 : 0

// TREND_CONTINUATION score: simplified — no sequence required
contScore = 0.0
contScore += emaTrendStrict ? 30 : (emaTrendFlexible ? 15 : 0)
contScore += sustainedHistDrop ? 20 : 0
contScore += vwapFalling ? 20 : 0
contScore += rsi < 38 ? 20 : (rsi < rsiMax ? 10 : 0)
contScore += volume > volMa * 1.5 ? 10 : 0

//──────── ENTRY TRIGGERS ────────
// Price must be below symbol's day open (avoid bad day losses for PUT)
priceBelowDayOpen = close < dayOpen

// DATA-DRIVEN MARKET QUALITY GATE (from 299-trade PUT OTM analysis):
//
// Finding 1 — NEUTRAL day + |hist| 0.30-0.80 = 49% WR, 5 HARD_SL (coin flip, blocked)
//   NEUTRAL day = niftyChange in (-0.5%, +0.4%). Outside this range: hist 0.30-0.80 is fine.
//   Reason: no market tailwind + mid-conviction signal = random outcome with downside asymmetry.
//
// Finding 2 — GOOD day + stock UP on day (dayChange >= 0) = 5 HARD_SL hits
//   On a rising NIFTY day, entering PUT on a stock that is itself UP is purely counter-trend.
//   3 of 5 had day_change > +0.6% → stock was strongly rallying, PUT had no chance.
neutralMarket       = niftyChange > -0.5 and niftyChange < 0.4
goodMarket          = niftyChange >= 0.4
neutralMidHistRisk  = neutralMarket and math.abs(macdHist) >= 0.30 and math.abs(macdHist) < 0.80
goodDayCounterTrend = goodMarket and (na(dayChange) or dayChange >= 0.0)
putMarketQualityOK  = not neutralMidHistRisk and not goodDayCounterTrend

macdBreakdownSetup = neutralBreakdownContext and sequenceReady

// FIX: deepBreakdownTrigger now uses trendFilterFlexible + sessionBreakdownFilter
// instead of trendFilterStrict + deadDropFilter.
// Root cause: stocks already in deep negative MACD territory scored 0-1/4 on
// dead-drop but had perfect EMA/VWAP/RSI breakdown structure — this blocked
// real losers like TECHM (-2.31%) that had RSI=30, price structure, sustained drop.
deepBreakdownTrigger = deepReversalSetup and sustainedHistDrop and trendFilterFlexible and rsiWeakness and bbFilter and priceStructure and sessionBreakdownFilter and putMarketQualityOK and inTradeWindow and isExpectedTimeframe and priceBelowDayOpen

momentumBreakdownTrigger = momentumAccelSetup and sustainedHistDrop and momentumTrendStrict and momentumHistAccel and momentumRSI and momentumVolume and momentumCandles and momentumVol and momentumNotExtended and sessionBreakdownFilter and putMarketQualityOK and inTradeWindow and isExpectedTimeframe and not deepBreakdownTrigger and priceBelowDayOpen

macdBreakdownTrigger = macdBreakdownSetup and sustainedHistDrop and trendFilterFlexible and rsiWeakness and bbFilter and priceStructure and sessionBreakdownFilter and putMarketQualityOK and isExpectedTimeframe and not deepBreakdownTrigger and not momentumBreakdownTrigger and priceBelowDayOpen

// TREND_CONTINUATION: fires on stocks already confirmed in a multi-bar downtrend.
// Guards against false positives on NEUTRAL/GOOD days:
//   - Per-stock day change must be ≤ -0.5% (confirmed loser for today)
//   - RSI must be < 38 (stock genuinely oversold / in momentum breakdown)
//   - Volume ≥ 1.5× average (institutional selling, not just noise)
//   - EMA trend must be bearish (ema9 < ema20)
//   - Not firing on any other trigger (no double-counting)
stockDayLoser = dayChange <= -0.50
// v6.4: falling-confluence tightening (mirror of CE rising-confluence). The breakdown must be
// ACTIVELY accelerating at the entry bar — this screens out the late/exhaustion entries (where
// RSI/EMA/volume flatten near the bottom of an already-extended fall) that produced 0% gains.
// v6.3: volume BAND instead of bare floor — moderate volume is the edge; >ceiling is capitulation.
// v6.4: + volume RISING (volume > volume[1]) — selling pressure must be increasing, not tapering.
contVolumeStrong = volume >= volMa * contVolFloor and volume < volMa * contVolCeil and volume > volume[1]
// v6.4: RSI must be oversold AND still FALLING (was absolute level only) — flattening RSI = exhaustion.
contRsiOversold = rsi < 38 and rsi < rsi[1]
// v6.4: EMA must be in downtrend AND ema9 actively falling (was loose emaTrendFlexible OR).
contEmaFalling = ema9 < ema20 and ema9 < ema9[1]
// Histogram quality gate: need real MACD momentum OR confirmed range expansion.
// Blocks hist ≈ 0 entries (too early / reversal risk) and late entries where
// histogram is flattening after a big day drop. rangeExpansion escape keeps
// borderline winners that show genuine range breakdown even with weak histogram.
contHistQuality = macdHist <= -0.20 or rangeExpansion
trendContinuationTrigger = stockDayLoser and contRsiOversold and contVolumeStrong and contEmaFalling and sustainedHistDrop and contHistQuality and vwapFalling and putMarketQualityOK and priceBelowDayOpen and inTradeWindow and isExpectedTimeframe and not deepBreakdownTrigger and not momentumBreakdownTrigger and not macdBreakdownTrigger

//──────── SIGNAL METRICS ────────
trend_strength = ema9[1] - ema9
rsi_expansion = rsi[1] - rsi
momentum_score = score
vol_expanding = volFilter ? 1 : 0
atr_expanding = atrExpansion ? 1 : 0
hist_accelerating = histVelocity ? 1 : 0
range_expanding = rangeExpansion ? 1 : 0
price_extended = notExtended ? 0 : 1
volume_ratio = volMa > 0 ? volume / volMa : 0.0
vwap_distance = vwapVal > 0 ? (vwapVal - close) / vwapVal * 100 : 0.0
ema_spread = ema20 > 0 ? (ema20 - ema9) / ema20 * 100 : 0.0
atr_pc = close > 0 ? atr / close * 100 : 0.0
signal_confidence = macdBreakdownTrigger ? math.max(90.0, math.min(100.0, score)) : math.min(100.0, score)
deep_confidence = deepBreakdownTrigger ? math.max(70.0, math.min(95.0, deepScore)) : math.min(95.0, deepScore)
mom_confidence = momentumBreakdownTrigger ? math.max(80.0, math.min(90.0, momScore)) : math.min(90.0, momScore)
cont_confidence = trendContinuationTrigger ? math.max(75.0, math.min(90.0, contScore)) : math.min(90.0, contScore)

marketTrendLabel = niftyChange <= -0.5 ? "BAD" : niftyChange < 0.4 ? "NEUTRAL" : "GOOD"

//──────── ALERT JSON ────────
format_value(x) => str.tostring(x, format.mintick)

jsonMsg_MACDBreakdown = "{\"symbol\":\"" + syminfo.ticker + "\",\"action\":\"SELL\",\"original_action\":\"BUY_PUT\",\"option_side\":\"PE\",\"entry_type\":\"MACD_BREAKDOWN\",\"price\":\"" + format_value(close) + "\",\"score\":\"" + format_value(score) + "\",\"confidence\":\"" + format_value(signal_confidence) + "\",\"market_trend\":\"" + marketTrendLabel + "\",\"trend_strength\":\"" + format_value(trend_strength) + "\",\"momentum_score\":\"" + format_value(momentum_score) + "\",\"rsi_value\":\"" + format_value(rsi) + "\",\"rsi_expansion\":\"" + format_value(rsi_expansion) + "\",\"macd_hist\":\"" + format_value(macdHist) + "\",\"bb_width\":\"" + format_value(bbWidth) + "\",\"day_change\":\"" + format_value(dayChange) + "\",\"vol_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(vol_expanding) + "\",\"atr_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(atr_expanding) + "\",\"hist_accelerating\":\"" + str.tostring(hist_accelerating) + "\",\"range_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(range_expanding) + "\",\"price_extended\":\"" + str.tostring(price_extended) + "\",\"vwap_distance\":\"" + format_value(vwap_distance) + "\",\"volume_ratio\":\"" + format_value(volume_ratio) + "\",\"ema_spread\":\"" + format_value(ema_spread) + "\",\"atr_pc\":\"" + format_value(atr_pc) + "\",\"tv_setup_label\":\"MACD_BREAKDOWN\",\"reentry_context_active\":\"false\",\"nifty50_change\":\"" + format_value(niftyChange) + "\"}"

jsonMsg_DeepBreakdown = "{\"symbol\":\"" + syminfo.ticker + "\",\"action\":\"SELL\",\"original_action\":\"BUY_PUT\",\"option_side\":\"PE\",\"entry_type\":\"DEEP_MACD_BREAKDOWN\",\"price\":\"" + format_value(close) + "\",\"score\":\"" + format_value(deepScore) + "\",\"confidence\":\"" + format_value(deep_confidence) + "\",\"market_trend\":\"" + marketTrendLabel + "\",\"trend_strength\":\"" + format_value(trend_strength) + "\",\"momentum_score\":\"" + format_value(deepScore) + "\",\"rsi_value\":\"" + format_value(rsi) + "\",\"rsi_expansion\":\"" + format_value(rsi_expansion) + "\",\"macd_hist\":\"" + format_value(macdHist) + "\",\"bb_width\":\"" + format_value(bbWidth) + "\",\"day_change\":\"" + format_value(dayChange) + "\",\"vol_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(vol_expanding) + "\",\"atr_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(atr_expanding) + "\",\"hist_accelerating\":\"" + str.tostring(hist_accelerating) + "\",\"range_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(range_expanding) + "\",\"price_extended\":\"" + str.tostring(price_extended) + "\",\"vwap_distance\":\"" + format_value(vwap_distance) + "\",\"volume_ratio\":\"" + format_value(volume_ratio) + "\",\"ema_spread\":\"" + format_value(ema_spread) + "\",\"atr_pc\":\"" + format_value(atr_pc) + "\",\"tv_setup_label\":\"DEEP_MACD_BREAKDOWN\",\"reentry_context_active\":\"false\",\"nifty50_change\":\"" + format_value(niftyChange) + "\"}"

jsonMsg_MomentumBreakdown = "{\"symbol\":\"" + syminfo.ticker + "\",\"action\":\"SELL\",\"original_action\":\"BUY_PUT\",\"option_side\":\"PE\",\"entry_type\":\"MOMENTUM_BREAKDOWN\",\"price\":\"" + format_value(close) + "\",\"score\":\"" + format_value(momScore) + "\",\"confidence\":\"" + format_value(mom_confidence) + "\",\"market_trend\":\"" + marketTrendLabel + "\",\"trend_strength\":\"" + format_value(trend_strength) + "\",\"momentum_score\":\"" + format_value(momScore) + "\",\"rsi_value\":\"" + format_value(rsi) + "\",\"rsi_expansion\":\"" + format_value(rsi_expansion) + "\",\"macd_hist\":\"" + format_value(macdHist) + "\",\"bb_width\":\"" + format_value(bbWidth) + "\",\"day_change\":\"" + format_value(dayChange) + "\",\"vol_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(vol_expanding) + "\",\"atr_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(atr_expanding) + "\",\"hist_accelerating\":\"" + str.tostring(hist_accelerating) + "\",\"range_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(range_expanding) + "\",\"price_extended\":\"" + str.tostring(price_extended) + "\",\"vwap_distance\":\"" + format_value(vwap_distance) + "\",\"volume_ratio\":\"" + format_value(volume_ratio) + "\",\"ema_spread\":\"" + format_value(ema_spread) + "\",\"atr_pc\":\"" + format_value(atr_pc) + "\",\"tv_setup_label\":\"MOMENTUM_BREAKDOWN\",\"reentry_context_active\":\"false\",\"nifty50_change\":\"" + format_value(niftyChange) + "\"}"

jsonMsg_TrendContinuation = "{\"symbol\":\"" + syminfo.ticker + "\",\"action\":\"SELL\",\"original_action\":\"BUY_PUT\",\"option_side\":\"PE\",\"entry_type\":\"TREND_CONTINUATION\",\"price\":\"" + format_value(close) + "\",\"score\":\"" + format_value(contScore) + "\",\"confidence\":\"" + format_value(cont_confidence) + "\",\"market_trend\":\"" + marketTrendLabel + "\",\"trend_strength\":\"" + format_value(trend_strength) + "\",\"momentum_score\":\"" + format_value(contScore) + "\",\"rsi_value\":\"" + format_value(rsi) + "\",\"rsi_expansion\":\"" + format_value(rsi_expansion) + "\",\"macd_hist\":\"" + format_value(macdHist) + "\",\"bb_width\":\"" + format_value(bbWidth) + "\",\"day_change\":\"" + format_value(dayChange) + "\",\"vol_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(vol_expanding) + "\",\"atr_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(atr_expanding) + "\",\"hist_accelerating\":\"" + str.tostring(hist_accelerating) + "\",\"range_expanding\":\"" + str.tostring(range_expanding) + "\",\"price_extended\":\"" + str.tostring(price_extended) + "\",\"vwap_distance\":\"" + format_value(vwap_distance) + "\",\"volume_ratio\":\"" + format_value(volume_ratio) + "\",\"ema_spread\":\"" + format_value(ema_spread) + "\",\"atr_pc\":\"" + format_value(atr_pc) + "\",\"tv_setup_label\":\"TREND_CONTINUATION\",\"reentry_context_active\":\"false\",\"nifty50_change\":\"" + format_value(niftyChange) + "\"}"

//──────── ALERT CONDITIONS ────────
alertcondition(macdBreakdownTrigger, title="MACD Breakdown Entry", message="MACD_BREAKDOWN_ENTRY")
alertcondition(deepBreakdownTrigger, title="Deep MACD Breakdown Entry", message="DEEP_MACD_BREAKDOWN_ENTRY")
alertcondition(momentumBreakdownTrigger, title="Momentum Breakdown Entry", message="MOMENTUM_BREAKDOWN_ENTRY")
alertcondition(trendContinuationTrigger, title="Trend Continuation Entry", message="TREND_CONTINUATION_ENTRY")

if macdBreakdownTrigger
    alert(jsonMsg_MACDBreakdown, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if deepBreakdownTrigger
    alert(jsonMsg_DeepBreakdown, alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if momentumBreakdownTrigger
    alert(jsonMsg_MomentumBreakdown, alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if trendContinuationTrigger
    alert(jsonMsg_TrendContinuation, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

//──────── LABELS ────────
if showLabels and macdBreakdownTrigger
    label.new(bar_index, low, "ENTRY\n(MB)\n" + str.tostring(score), style=label.style_label_up, color=color.red, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
if showLabels and deepBreakdownTrigger
    label.new(bar_index, low - 0.5, "ENTRY\n(DMB)\n" + str.tostring(deepScore), style=label.style_label_up, color=color.orange, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
if showLabels and momentumBreakdownTrigger
    label.new(bar_index, low - 1.0, "ENTRY\n(MOM)\n" + str.tostring(momScore), style=label.style_label_up, color=color.maroon, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
if showLabels and trendContinuationTrigger
    label.new(bar_index, low - 1.5, "ENTRY\n(CONT)\n" + str.tostring(contScore), style=label.style_label_up, color=color.purple, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)

plotshape(showLabels and macdBreakdownTrigger, title="ENTRY FLAG - MACD_BREAKDOWN", text="MB", style=shape.labeldown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.red, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(showLabels and deepBreakdownTrigger, title="ENTRY FLAG - DEEP_MACD_BREAKDOWN", text="DMB", style=shape.labeldown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.orange, textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(showLabels and momentumBreakdownTrigger, title="ENTRY FLAG - MOMENTUM_BREAKDOWN", text="MOM", style=shape.labeldown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.maroon, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(showLabels and trendContinuationTrigger, title="ENTRY FLAG - TREND_CONTINUATION", text="CONT", style=shape.labeldown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.purple, textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)

//──────── PLOTS ────────
plot(ema9, color=color.yellow, title="EMA9")
plot(ema20, color=color.orange, title="EMA20")
plot(bbUpper, color=color.gray, title="BB Upper")
plot(bbLower, color=color.gray, title="BB Lower")
bgcolor(not isExpectedTimeframe ? color.new(color.red, 88) : na, title="Use 1-Minute Chart")
